WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:11.520
ARYA STARK: I know Death.

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:16.480
He's got many faces.

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:22.340
I look forward to seeing this one.

00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:32.240
BRAN STARK: Everything you did brought you where you are now.

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:36.880
Where you belong.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Home.

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:51.980
JON SNOW: They're coming.

00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:55.520
Our enemy doesn't tire.

00:00:57.880 --> 00:00:59.060
Doesn't stop.

00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:01.800
Doesn't feel.

00:01:15.160 --> 00:01:17.400
JAIME LANNISTER: I promised to fight for the living.

00:01:19.560 --> 00:01:21.040
I intend to keep that promise.

